      <title>AI is stealing Indigenous Australian art and churning out ‘Temu slop’, artist says</title>
      <link>https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/nov/02/ai-stealing-indigenous-australian-art-temu-slop-artist-says-ntwnfb</link>
